# graphify output.
#
# Regenerable by re-running /graphify, and pinned to the machine that produced
# it: .graphify_root and .graphify_python hold absolute paths, and manifest.json
# and cache/stat-index.json carry more of them. Syncing it would hand every other
# machine a root pointing at somebody else's home directory.
graphify-out/
